<main>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <h1 class="page-title">Past gifts. Future smiles.</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      Here are the donations I have completed so far. Each event shares how small
      3D printed gifts can bring smiles to children and families.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="past">
    <h2 class="section-title">Past Donations</h2>


    <div class="timeline">
      <article class="timeline-item">
        <div class="timeline-date">Completed</div>
        <div>
          <span class="badge">Past Event</span>
          <h3>Washington Health Foundation Keychain Donation</h3>
          <p>
            I designed and donated 100 3D Printed keychains for Washington Health Foundation to share
            small gifts with patients and families.
          </p>
          <p>July 2026</p>

          <div class="photo-grid" aria-label="Washington Hospital Fremont donation photos">
            <img
              class="event-photo event-photo-full"
              src="/washington-hospital-keychains-prep.jpg"
              alt="Vihaan with 3D printed keychains prepared for Washington Hospital Fremont"
            />
            <img
              class="event-photo event-photo-full"
              src="/washington-hospital-donation-sign.jpg"
              alt="Vihaan outside Washington Hospital Fremont with donated 3D printed keychains"
            />
          </div>

          <p class="class-note">
            Washington Health Foundation Keychain Donation.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="timeline-item">
        <div class="timeline-date">Completed</div>
        <div>
          <span class="badge">Past Event</span>
          <h3>UCSF Children’s Hospital Keychain Donation</h3>
          <p>
            I designed and donated 21 3D Printed keychains for UCSF Children’s Hospital as part of my effort
            to bring joy to children through small, thoughtful gifts.
          </p>
          <p>May 2026</p>

          <div class="photo-grid" aria-label="UCSF Children’s Hospital donation photos">
            <img
              class="event-photo"
              src="/ucsf-donation-photo.jpg"
              alt="Vihaan at UCSF Benioff Children’s Hospital with donated keychains"
            />
          </div>

          <p class="class-note">
            UCSF Children’s Hospital keychain donation.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

